        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Fleece, polyethylene, at plant
The functional unit represents 1 kg of fleece out of polyethylene.;
UUID: 76d6a372-a1cf-3d45-8110-592f01067753
Raw materials and chemicals used for production, transport of materials to manufacturing plant, energy consumption and waste amounts from a company. Infrastructure of the plant as an approximation.
Location: data from 1 Swiss company are used for the European average
Technology: technology used within Europe in the beginning of the 90s
Time period: time to which data refer
Production volume: na
Sampling: Process data based on data from 1 Swiss  company, used here as average data for European situation. 
Extrapolations: see geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_76d6a372-a1cf-3d45-8110-592f01067753.xml</text>
